# Pi extensions/packages to install at image build time.
#
# One `pi install` source per line. Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are
# ignored. Exact pins are strongly recommended for reproducible builds:
#
#   npm:@scope/package@1.2.3
#   git:github.com/owner/repo@v1.2.3
#   ./local-directory
#
# See https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/blob/main/packages/coding-agent/docs/packages.md
#
# The security guard is NOT listed here: it is part of this project and is
# copied into the image from extensions/pi-security-guard/.
#
# Examples (uncomment to use):
# npm:@example/pi-tools@1.0.0
# git:github.com/example/pi-tools@v1
